    "title": "About Us",
    "subtitle": "Building excellence through innovation and dedication",
    "overviewTitle": "OVERVIEW",
    "overviewText": "<p>We at PISL are recognised as India's leading construction company, providing services to well-reputed clientele in various sectors.</p><p>PISL is the product of passion, hard work, and integrity. To us, excellence is a habit, and we always strive to do our best. We are an organisation with a strong ethical compass and a spectacular track record of excellence in the industry. Over the past 17+ years, our proven expertise has led us to build multiple projects covering millions of square meters in the construction industry.</p><p>We are present across various sectors like copper smelting, food processing, radial wires, automobile, heavy engineering, MSME, chemical, and other sectors.</p><p>With a strong background in engineering and construction, we know how to make ideas and plans become real things. We are in the relentless pursuit of value creation, skill-building, and strengthening the infrastructural fabric of the nation with our passion and commitment.</p>",
    "capabilitiesTitle": "OUR CAPABILITIES",
    "valuesTitle": "OUR VALUES",
